pHash":3656837426,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[705080202]},{"nodeId":705080202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":2672905042,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[705080203]},{"nodeId":705080203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2451391794,"text":"ど、どうだ？なんか言ってくれよ。緊張するだろ！","nextNodeIds":[705080204]},{"nodeId":705080204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":2646924946,"text":"そうね…かつての苦い思い出が蘇り、今の幸せをかみ締められるような味だわ。","nextNodeIds":[705080205]},{"nodeId":705080205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":4286114810,"text":"ん？無一文から事業を成功させた味か？どんな味だよ、それ。","nextNodeIds":[705080206]},{"nodeId":705080206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":3120149690,"text":"ふふっ…甘酸っぱくて、余韻のある味よ。","nextNodeIds":[705080207]},{"nodeId":705080207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":215259306,"text":"あー…小さな商売で果物を売っても、あんま儲からないことに気付いた時の味か？","nextNodeIds":[705080208]},{"nodeId":705080208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":3285643282,"text":"わざわざ言葉にする必要なんてないのよ。過去のことは過去のこととして、ただ味わえばね。","nextNodeIds":[705080209]},{"nodeId":705080209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":815682554,"text":"ははっ、高貴な天権様が街中で果物を売ってたなんて、誰が想像できるだろうな。","nextNodeIds":[705080210]},{"nodeId":705080210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":3313484546,"text":"アタシが元は漁師だったのと同じくらい、信じられない話だろ？","nextNodeIds":[705080211]},{"nodeId":705080211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":1686849786,"text":"そんなことないわ。私から見たら…","nextNodeIds":[705080212]},{"nodeId":705080212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":2466287370,"text":"北斗船長の海を見通すその目も、波を乗り越えて前へと進むその心も、海に囲まれながら生まれてきた人のものだわ。","nextNodeIds":[705080213]},{"nodeId":705080213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":3229438938,"text":"おいおい、それはアタシを褒めてんのか？","nextNodeIds":[705080214]},{"nodeId":705080214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":1476815274,"text":"あなたの悪口を言っても、何のメリットもないでしょ。","nextNodeIds":[705080215]},{"nodeId":705080215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":608086066,"text":"まったく、あんたの口が上手いのは知ってたが、今日は元々アタシのおごりなんだ、これ以上は何も出ないぞ。","nextNodeIds":[705080216]},{"nodeId":705080216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":690811498,"text":"ふふっ…そうね。なら、もっといただこうかしら。","nextNodeIds":[705080217,705080218]},{"nodeId":705080217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2343547650,"text":"おかわりする？","nextNodeIds":[705080219]},{"nodeId":705080218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":91082506,"text":"心からおもてなしさせてもらう。","nextNodeIds":[705080219]},{"nodeId":705080219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1277314330,"text":"よし、バーテンダー、もう一杯だ！","nextNodeIds":[705080220]},{"nodeId":705080220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":2487473194,"text":"おっ、威勢がいいな！じゃ、アタシももう一杯いただくか！","nextNodeIds":[705080221]},{"nodeId":705080234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":2780421026,"text":"二人におかわりをやった…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705080221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":2062991514,"text":"ふぅ、モンドのジュースは美味しいわね。毎日飲めたらいいのに。","nextNodeIds":[705080222]},{"nodeId":705080222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":3306528010,"text":"ん？まさかとは思うが、夕暮れの実の貿易ルートを開拓したいとか言い出さないよな…","nextNodeIds":[705080223]},{"nodeId":705080223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":2012756514,"text":"あら、面白そうね。","nextNodeIds":[705080224]},{"nodeId":705080224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":1363223554,"text":"おい、本気か？","nextNodeIds":[705080225]},{"nodeId":705080225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":836282386,"text":"冗談よ。夕暮れの実に関する貿易は、既に一定規模で行われているわ。だから、私が手を出す必要なんてないの。","nextNodeIds":[705080226]},{"nodeId":705080226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":4017279634,"text":"#{NICKNAME}、今日はありがとう。もしのんびりと働ける仕事に就きたくなったら、私の専用バーテンダーになってみるのはどうかしら。","nextNodeIds":[705080227]},{"nodeId":705080227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1031,"speakerName":"北斗","textMapHash":2066252002,"text":"それなら、ウチの「死兆星」号に来ないか。みんな酒が好きでな。あんたがもし来てくれたら、思う存分酒を飲んで、たらふく肉を食うんだ。絶対に楽しいはずだぜ。","nextNodeIds":[705080228]},{"nodeId":705080228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10211,"speakerName":"凝光","textMapHash":1061283426,"text":"北斗船長は私と人材の奪い合いをする気？そんな必要はないわ。旅人の作った飲み物が飲みたくなったら、群玉閣に来ればいいでしょう？","nextNodeIds":[705080229]},{"nodeId":705080229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3027398346,"text":"#（すごい、二人が{M#俺}{F#私}を取り合ってる！）","nextNodeIds":[705080230]},{"nodeId":705080230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":587835450,"text":"いつの間にか、あいつらの中でおまえを雇うことは決定してるみたいだな…","nextNodeIds":[705080231,705080232]},{"nodeId":705080231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2316137530,"text":"機会があったら…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705080232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":206575154,"text":"必ず行くよ、きっと…","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7050802,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1068,50],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q7050204_Play"}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["1068","201068004"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QU